{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fairly short adventure that you can play in around 5 hours. It's atmospheric and a little bit funny. You are a blob of oil and you have to escape from the oil industry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/52be4e3abea50c25e2a9a838fa64d27f.poster.avif?t=1770070553\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/52be4e3abea50c25e2a9a838fa64d27f.webm?t=1770070553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/52be4e3abea50c25e2a9a838fa64d27f.mp4?t=1770070553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bounce Around</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splat off the walls, bowl thru stacks of barrels, and skate across puddles as an elastic blob with Mario-like moves. Slow time to pull a tricky maneuver, or just to savor your character\u2019s outlandish acrobatics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/89f716c4e6cea81ec48c034462e6ae34.poster.avif?t=1770070553\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/89f716c4e6cea81ec48c034462e6ae34.webm?t=1770070553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/89f716c4e6cea81ec48c034462e6ae34.mp4?t=1770070553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Huge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and launch oil droplets to grow into a formidable glob or shrink to a modest slick. Try on different hats for a variety of short-term power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b5213da178802367b8004705d9cf1938.poster.avif?t=1770070553\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b5213da178802367b8004705d9cf1938.webm?t=1770070553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b5213da178802367b8004705d9cf1938.mp4?t=1770070553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a forklift to lift and stack heavy obstacles to suit your oily needs. Mix it up with rude robots.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b55c2dba431c0ef6ee8f7f7d2db9bfd4.poster.avif?t=1770070553\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b55c2dba431c0ef6ee8f7f7d2db9bfd4.webm?t=1770070553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b55c2dba431c0ef6ee8f7f7d2db9bfd4.mp4?t=1770070553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OST by Body Meat!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1653020?t=1770070553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/81dadc843765da74e58740b60bc18991f88620cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770070553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/5f8414a639ea70dc105dc09073acc2fa41faea0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770070553","cap